{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascent of Eternity is the first game being developed by Seventh Eye Studio in Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A primordial trial exists.<br>Reborn in the punctum of eternity, a path to immortality has been presented to you.<br>Through the 7 eternal dimensions ancient powers seek to annihilate you. In eternity many challenges exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven Eternal Dimensions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punctum, Epirynth, Tertiamsion, Tesseration, Dodeciahysion, Hexerasion, and Hepternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through randomized  dimensional worlds of increasing dimensional complexity to conquer Eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 Elemental Paths:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first 7 elemental paths, Fire, Ice, Electric, Light, Dark, Metal, and Life are the starting point of mastery. Each path has a unique set of 7 magical abilities with increasing strength. You must progress through the paths by defeating enemies in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and Deities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarmed from all sides. stepping into dimensions will summon a horde of opposition. Powerful foes and forces seek to deny your ascent. Defeat or be defeated by endless swarms of enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path to immortality is not a simple one. Embrace the allure of magical power to control the elements and dimensions. Massively action packed magical combat chaos awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613130?t=1756227602","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613130?t=1756227602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613130/28f188ae4c20b5c45922ea15c44ebd2c3431954f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756227602","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613130/28f188ae4c20b5c45922ea15c44ebd2c3431954f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756227602","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascent of Eternity is the first game being developed by Seventh Eye Studio in Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A primordial trial exists.<br>Reborn in the punctum of eternity, a path to immortality has been presented to you.<br>Through the 7 eternal dimensions ancient powers seek to annihilate you. In eternity many challenges exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven Eternal Dimensions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punctum, Epirynth, Tertiamsion, Tesseration, Dodeciahysion, Hexerasion, and Hepternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through randomized  dimensional worlds of increasing dimensional complexity to conquer Eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 Elemental Paths:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first 7 elemental paths, Fire, Ice, Electric, Light, Dark, Metal, and Life are the starting point of mastery. Each path has a unique set of 7 magical abilities with increasing strength. You must progress through the paths by defeating enemies in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and Deities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarmed from all sides. stepping into dimensions will summon a horde of opposition. Powerful foes and forces seek to deny your ascent. Defeat or be defeated by endless swarms of enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path to immortality is not a simple one. Embrace the allure of magical power to control the elements and dimensions. Massively action packed magical combat chaos awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","developers":["Seventh Eye Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613130/26ed12f69e75eccf30e93b0cd229e285d92f3244/header.jpg?t=1756227602","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright SEVENTH EYE STUDIO LLC. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257189211,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189211/movie480.mp4?t=1756227599","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189211/movie_max.mp4?t=1756227599"},"name":"Cinematic Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189211/586ea83cc225a3bd10b4a96a319d3ce4b98f5239/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756227599","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189211/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756227599","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189211/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756227599"}}],"name":"Ascent Of Eternity","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Seventh Eye Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt